From: Hades <15710513+hadesdevls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 04:01:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [Hades][Settings] The upscalers AiUpscale (film) and
 (animation) in Spanish in the settings

The three upscaler settings of Player > Videos list AiUpscale (film) and
AiUpscale (animation), strings 62082 and 62083 of the core. The settings
window takes a string of Hades in the language of the interface only
where GetLocalizedString() maps it to its Estuary string; the mapping of
the upscalers stopped at 62075, so in Spanish those two values were
shown in English (the video settings of the player, which ask for them
by both ids, showed them translated). Their Estuary strings, 54082 and
54083, are there in en_gb, es_es, es_ar and es_mx.
---
 xbmc/settings/dialogs/GUIDialogSettingsBase.cpp | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/xbmc/settings/dialogs/GUIDialogSettingsBase.cpp b/xbmc/settings/dialogs/GUIDialogSettingsBase.cpp
index c193707..05247e3 100644
--- a/xbmc/settings/dialogs/GUIDialogSettingsBase.cpp
+++ b/xbmc/settings/dialogs/GUIDialogSettingsBase.cpp
@@ -791,6 +791,9 @@ std::string CGUIDialogSettingsBase::GetLocalizedString(uint32_t labelId) const
   // labels, help, values (Estuary: the core id less 8000)
   if (labelId >= 62060 && labelId <= 62075)
     return CGUIUtils::GetHadesString(labelId, labelId - 8000);
+  // ... and the values AiUpscale (film) and AiUpscale (animation) of the upscalers
+  if (labelId == 62082 || labelId == 62083)
+    return CGUIUtils::GetHadesString(labelId, labelId - 8000);
   // SDR videos of BT.2020 sent as they are (System > Display): label, help
   if (labelId == 62120 || labelId == 62121)
     return CGUIUtils::GetHadesString(labelId, 54120 + (labelId - 62120));
